  "title": "CMake: Require C++17",
  "description": "Qt 6 requires C++17, and so does libsinsp. Supported platforms and\ndistributions have compilers that support C++17. (Even RHEL 8, which\ndoes not officially distribute Qt 6, uses GCC 8 by default as the\nsystem compiler, which has full C++17 support and is able to compile\nQt 6.)\n\nAlso require C17; essentially every compiler treats this and C11 as\nthe same, aside from the definition of __STDC_VERSION__, and it is\nalso supported by all supported platforms and distributions.\n\nCI jobs for the stable branches will verify that any changed code\nstill works.\n\nAI-Assisted: no",
